{"query_id": "q_p01_03", "person_id": "p01", "text": "庭で一番大事に育てている花は何だったかしら。", "query_type": "paraphrase", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "dev", "note": "バラ→花"}
{"query_id": "q_p01_04", "person_id": "p01", "text": "最近、朝の飲み物を変えたってお話ししたけれど、何にしたんだったかしら。", "query_type": "paraphrase", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "test", "note": "更新された好み"}
{"query_id": "q_p01_05", "person_id": "p01", "text": "ゆいちゃんがとまりにくるのはいつだったかしら。", "query_type": "notation", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "dev", "note": "漢字→ひらがな"}
