{"query_id": "q_p01_10", "person_id": "p01", "text": "犬の散歩の時間って決まっていたかしら。", "query_type": "no_answer", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "test", "note": "本人は犬を飼っていない（p13 は飼っている）"}
{"query_id": "q_p02_01", "person_id": "p02", "text": "文子を物忘れ外来に連れて行くのはいつだったかな。", "query_type": "direct", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "dev", "note": ""}
{"query_id": "q_p02_02", "person_id": "p02", "text": "将棋クラブの大会で何位だったっけ。", "query_type": "direct", "filters": {"date_from": null, "date_to": null, "category": null}, "asked_on": "2026-11-01", "split": "dev", "note": "過去の大会（予定の大会は別）"}
